This product is an independent, from-scratch Rust implementation whose
architecture is derived from and inspired by SGLang
(https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang), which is also licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The serving runtime under `pagoda/` is an independent Rust implementation
whose architecture is inspired by SGLang. Design lineage is documented in
pagoda/docs/DESIGN.md.

`rs-mm/` ports the still-image preprocessing algorithms from SGLang's
`rust/sglang-mm` (Qwen2-VL smart_resize, patchify, token layout, and the
PIL/ATen resize kernels), also Apache-2.0. PyO3 bindings, serde specs, and
the rayon pool are not included. This notice is kept as attribution and
provenance documentation: pagoda and SGLang share the Apache-2.0 ecosystem,
and we aim to keep that relationship transparent and cooperative.
